OL,3,ABurnham and EU leaders making statement
OL,4,Aafter talks on Brexit reset deal -
OL,5,Awatch live
OL,6,
OL,7,FWatch live above as Andy Burnham and EU
OL,8,Fofficials make a statement following
OL,9,Ftalks on a new UK-EU deal
OL,11,FThe agreement covers issues such as
OL,12,Fyouth mobility, food exports, carbon
OL,13,Femissions and migration - our political
OL,14,Freporter takes you through the detail
OL,16,FEarlier, the UK said a "deal is done"
OL,17,Fwith Burnham saying it's "really
OL,18,Fsignificant" and will bring benefits to
OL,19,Fpeople across Europe and the UK
